<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Inquiry Received - Stable Partners</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
            background-color: #F8FAFC; 
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #1E293B;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #1800AC;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }
        .content h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin: 0 0 16px 0;
            color: #0F172A;
        }
        .content p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
            color: #475569;
        }
        .accent-box {
            background-color: #EFF6FF;
            border-left: 4px solid #1800AC;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 32px 0;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }
        .accent-box h2 {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: #1800AC;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #F1F5F9;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748B;
            border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #1800AC;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header" style="background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;">
                <img src="https://stablepartnersgroup.com/stable-patners-logo.jpg" alt="Stable Partners" style="height: 50px; width: auto;">
            </div>
            
            <div class="content">
                <h1>Assessment Request<br>Received.</h1>
                <p>Hello <%= locals.name %>,</p>
                <p>Thank you for initiating a property assessment with Stable Partners. We have received your details regarding your portfolio and management goals.</p>
                
                <div class="accent-box">
                    <h2>Next Steps</h2>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px;">A senior portfolio strategist is currently analyzing your data. You can expect a personalized response or a direct consultation invitation within 24 business hours.</p>
                </div>

                <p>In the meantime, if you have any additional documentation or specific questions, simply reply to this email.</p>
                
                <p>To your success,<br><strong>The Stable Partners Team</strong></p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                &copy; 2026 Stable Partners Group. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
